---
// What the RdRp Summit is, for someone arriving from a search. It does not
// change between editions, so the homepage puts it under the summit banner
// while a summit is announced (Preview / Live) and on top otherwise.
---

<section class="about-summary">
	<div class="container">
		<h2>About RdRp Summit</h2>
		<p>
			The RdRp Summit is a global research community focused on RNA-dependent RNA polymerase (RdRp),
			a key enzyme shared by all RNA viruses. We bring together researchers to advance the discovery,
			classification, and analysis of RNA viruses through open discussion, shared data, and community-driven standards.
		</p>
		<a
			href="https://forms.gle/oPdeSmmLnQTi8UAB8"
			target="_blank"
			rel="noopener noreferrer"
			class="link-arrow"
		>
			Join the community on Slack &rarr;
		</a>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.container {
		max-width: 980px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 20px;
	}
	.about-summary {
		text-align: center;
		padding: 60px 0 40px;
		background: var(--c-bg);
	}
	.about-summary h2 {
		font-size: 2rem;
		line-height: 1.2;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		font-weight: 700;
	}
	.about-summary p {
		color: var(--c-text-secondary);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		max-width: 700px;
		margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
	}
	.link-arrow {
		font-size: 14px;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--c-link);
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	.link-arrow:hover {
		text-decoration: underline;
	}
</style>
